# Line-ending conversion is turned off for the whole repository.
#
# This is a correctness requirement, not a style preference. SHA-256 hashes of
# file bytes are load-bearing throughout this study:
#
#   taxonomy/TAXONOMY_PROVENANCE.json   the frozen taxonomy and family mapping
#   data/review_snapshot_manifest.json  every review packet file
#   data/sampling/*.json                the frozen review manifest
#
# ssr.taxonomy.verify_provenance re-hashes the taxonomy on every analysis run
# and fails if it has moved. A checkout that rewrote LF to CRLF would change
# those bytes and make a correct repository look tampered with.
#
# The harness writes every file with LF endings (ssr.util.write_text), so the
# working tree stays consistent on Windows and Linux alike.
* -text
